# ArduPilot Copter 4.7 parameters: PosHold with UWB for horizontal position only, height from baro.
# UWB comes from a Raspberry Pi on SERIAL2 (MAVLink2, 921600).
# Mission Planner: Config > Full Parameter List > Load from file > Write Params, then reboot.
# Not included, set them for your vehicle: VISO_POS_X/Y/Z (tag position on the frame, FRD).
SERIAL2_PROTOCOL,2
SERIAL2_BAUD,921
SERIAL2_OPTIONS,0
GPS1_TYPE,0
VISO_TYPE,1
VISO_DELAY_MS,10
VISO_POS_M_NSE,0.1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY,6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY,0
EK3_SRC1_POSZ,1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ,0
EK3_SRC1_YAW,1
